      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I did up vote this thread but seem like you posted in the wrong place , if you would want to manually move the bones of the tracker you would need to ask that to steam, I wanted them to do so too , because the hips bone is a problem but legs 99% of the time are fine , but with new driver4vr ver.3 drivers we can now move the hips bones manually but im guessing you are using a vive",
