  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know this effects the minority of users but it can be really frustrating that an avatar floats or, their hips contort in awful ways due to slight differences in proportion. I don't know if it's possible but is like to be able to manually place the trackers one by one where they would go. Perhaps this is just wishful thinking, but I would like to see this feature fleshed out a bit more.",
